# L §8.2 before from:, tally 2.1.8 R13 (STOP-REPORT 5 of T's re-run, pick P37 with P34, P36; T's m2/items/explain/
# from): under windows each a block's register is the read set of the days it covers, so advw, dated by wd
# (2026-12-20 .. 2026-12-28), lists its entry with each day: bl and fl, whose answer is the same on every day, list
# them all; blw's first block its days; the plain line none, as 2.1.7 printed and T stores. ed4f1be4 listed none.
=== m.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "T, M2 C2, G2 (#164 R7, #163): before from: under flows (fl) and under bal (bl), for an instance dated before the scenario's from whose law date is after it (adv); a leg whose day is a window (advw) under windows each (blw)"

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input adv_day: date
input adv_law: date
input wd: date

move adv: transfers
  on adv_day
  at adv_law
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

move advw: transfers
  on wd
  at adv_law
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

version base
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "own"
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version dates
  cite plan
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  adv_day = 2026-12-15 "own"
  adv_law = 2027-01-01 "own"
  wd = window(2026-12-20, 2026-12-28) "own"

ask fl: flows(konto, 2026-12-01 .. 2027-01-31) in late windows each
ask bl: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in late windows each
ask blw: bal(konto, 2026-12-24) in late windows each
ask bl_plain: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in late
=== late.tally
scenario late over household
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

version late_amt
  cite plan
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace amt = 20.00 PLN "own"
=== expect
bl: 60.00 PLN
  world: late
  before from: adv on 2026-12-15 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-20 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-21 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-22 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-23 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-24 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-25 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-26 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-27 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-28 reads amt
  held: amt = 20.00 PLN (late_amt), read for 2027-01-01
  cut 2026-10-20
bl_plain: 60.00 PLN
  world: late
  before from: adv on 2026-12-15 reads amt
  held: amt = 20.00 PLN (late_amt), read for 2027-01-01
  cut 2026-10-20
blw [wd = 2026-12-20 .. 2026-12-24]: 60.00 PLN
  world: late
  before from: adv on 2026-12-15 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-20 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-21 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-22 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-23 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-24 reads amt
  held: amt = 20.00 PLN (late_amt), read for 2027-01-01
  cut 2026-10-20
blw [wd = 2026-12-25 .. 2026-12-28]: 80.00 PLN
  world: late
  before from: adv on 2026-12-15 reads amt
  held: amt = 20.00 PLN (late_amt), read for 2027-01-01
  cut 2026-10-20
fl: -40.00 PLN
  world: late
  before from: adv on 2026-12-15 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-20 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-21 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-22 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-23 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-24 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-25 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-26 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-27 reads amt
  before from: advw on 2026-12-28 reads amt
  held: amt = 20.00 PLN (late_amt), read for 2027-01-01
  cut 2026-10-20
